{"term":"Latte","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"organs","subcategory":"penis","concept":"erect_penis","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":62,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":85,"recognition_pct_peak":88,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"German slang for the erect penis, literally 'batten' or 'wooden slat'; 'eine Latte haben' (to have a batten) means to have an erection.","english_term":"boner","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"One of the most widely recognized and frequently used penis slang terms in German; specifically denotes erection rather than the flaccid organ; appears in Bundesliga football slang ('er hat eine Latte getroffen' = he hit the crossbar) creating unavoidable double entendres."}
