{"term":"Dreizack","lang":"de","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"organs","subcategory":"penis","concept":"penis","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_neutral","crude":38,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":30,"recognition_pct_peak":40,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"German slang for penis, literally 'trident'; a humorous phallic metaphor invoking the shaft of the three-pronged weapon rather than its prongs.","english_term":"trident","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"The irony of using a three-pronged implement for a single-pronged organ is likely intentional; less common than other weapon/tool metaphors; occasionally used in ironic or pompous register for humorous effect."}
